            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "NOTE: This game is in English only and is local multiplayer.This is the standalone version of Fibbage XL, which appears in The Jackbox Party Pack.<br><br>It’s Fibbage XL – the hilarious bluffing party game from The Jackbox Party Pack! Fool your friends with your lies, avoid theirs, and find the (usually outrageous) truth. And get this: your phone or tablet (or keyboard) is your only controller! It’s easy. Just type in your lies to questions like: “The mayor of Rabbit Hash, Kentucky is a _____.” Baby? Rabbit? Ham sandwich? It’s up to you! Fool your opponents into thinking your lie is true and you’ll rack up the points! But be careful, if you pick an opponent’s lie, they’ll be doing a Fibbage fancy dance. For 2-8 players.<br><br>New features not in existing versions of Fibbage or Fibbage XL:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Family-Friendly Filter<br></li><li>Twitch log-in capability<br></li><li>More fun!</li></ul>",
